WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
The project failed, and my manager blamed me.

00:06.000 --> 00:11.000
He threw me under the bus.

00:11.000 --> 00:16.000
Oh, great. Just what I needed.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000
If I were you,

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
I would sleep on it.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
I didn't say she stole the money.

00:31.000 --> 00:36.000
Let's not jump to conclusions.

00:37.000 --> 00:44.000
Fair enough. I'll give her the benefit of the doubt.
